  "notes": "こっち is the casual form of こちら.\n\nKO-SO-A-DO SERIES:\n- こっち (this way - near speaker)\n- そっち (that way - near listener)\n- あっち (over there - away from both)\n- どっち (which way - question)\n\nFORMALITY:\n- こっち (casual)\n- こちら (polite)",
